Alembic migrations for the nebus payment service.

The database URL is injected at runtime from `shared.config.settings`
(asyncpg DSN), so no credentials live in alembic.ini.

Common commands (run from the repository root):

    make migrate                               # alembic upgrade head
    make makemigration ARGS="-m 'add payments'"   # autogenerate a revision
    uv run alembic downgrade -1                 # roll back one revision
    uv run alembic history                      # list revisions

Models live in `shared/src/shared/models/` and must subclass
`shared.db.base.Base` to be picked up by autogenerate.
